<title>UK: 3I Holdings sets 100 mln stg five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>3I Holdings sets 100 mln stg five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   3I HOLDINGS PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  3I GROUP PLC</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   MARGIN     3.125 BP  MATURITY   *28.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3MLIBOR   PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  15 BP     ISS PRICE  99.87     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL AT PAR FROM FEB 2000</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A1/AA-    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   LISTING    LONDON    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
